WEBVTT

00:12:29.676 --> 00:12:32.356
The thing you write with. What's that"

00:12:32.396 --> 00:12:33.556
"Pen?" "Yeah" --

00:12:33.596 --> 00:12:36.956
if that starts happening,
that could be something.

00:12:36.956 --> 00:12:38.476
Doesn't have to be Alzheimer's.

00:12:38.516 --> 00:12:43.396
There are lots of reasons
for having issues with retrieving memories

00:12:43.396 --> 00:12:44.676
making new memories.

00:12:44.716 --> 00:12:46.116
It can be sleep deprivation,

00:12:46.116 --> 00:12:48.636
it could be B12, it can be lots of things.

00:12:48.676 --> 00:12:50.836
So you don't have to just
jump to Alzheimer's.

00:12:50.876 --> 00:12:53.276
But it is something
that you can hopefully address.

00:12:53.276 --> 00:12:55.836
Again, be involved in your brain health.

00:12:56.436 --> 00:12:59.716
The other has to do
with understanding how things work,

00:12:59.716 --> 00:13:00.916
what things are for.